        "response": "[Awaiting tool approval]\n\n**Policy:** Shell command approval (skills demo)\nAbout to run a shell command in the agent workspace. Approve to continue?\n**Required Tools:** run_command\n```python\nrun_output = await run_command(\"cd workspace/scripts && python summarize_sales.py\")\nprint(run_output)\n\nhas_error = \"Traceback\" in run_output or \"Error\" in run_output\nprint(f\"has_error={has_error}\")\nprint(f\"output_length={len(run_output)}\")\nprint(\"--- First 500 chars ---\")\nprint(run_output[:500])\n\n# Clean up the erroneous file at root-level docs/\nawait run_command(\"rm -f ./docs/sales_summary.txt && rmdir ./docs 2>/dev/null; true\")\nprint(\"Cleaned up erroneous root-level docs/\")\n\n# Write the correct output to workspace/docs/sales_summary.txt\nwrite_result = await write_file(\"./workspace/docs/sales_summary.txt\", run_output)\nprint(write_result)\n\nverified = await read_file(\"./workspace/docs/sales_summary.txt\")\nprint(verified)\n```",
